{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c3450d2085837b681aff181ea21b6fe0a9b391890a51e3dfe17c07a1557c9b2a",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebab3f447e984db95428ccb6e839e6c70eaadc37081b469136f40c80f73ae3b4",
      "text": "因为有你在注视着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de00847197a5917b41d7f6185e25ef62f169fbb4153ddfa36b7b7f3fa4497d6c",
      "text": "每天早晨都努力打理发型的隼人。自认为十分讲究，却被哥哥吐槽“根本看不出有什么变化”。尽管如此，隼人依然重新振作起来，原因是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebab3f447e984db95428ccb6e839e6c70eaadc37081b469136f40c80f73ae3b4",
      "text": "因为有你在注视着我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd52f14ad2990ccfcd2590e3e37c04f82c031e63d042b3205ddb873ebdd9240",
      "text": "（嗯——好像听到了什么声音……\n啊啊，这是闹钟声啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e376dd3bdc31e6bdb65863d188eeb04a13c0ad80b7b26f9517bd24151eedf9f3",
      "text": "已经7点了吗……\n得起床了……哈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9ee804866744fbe85b21c494309400552118072eecdb40937169c6e2604203c",
      "text": "（忙着准备工作的事，\n搞得太晚睡了啊——……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1919d0cf21ade76088a2f374d0a839a3dfd6584639779a427033694279c0f7b",
      "text": "呼啊～……\n如果一天能多出8个小时，就能多睡会儿了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c348d1a249f0c498b14824a64655391bebffce25a60e6d8118d3eb9500b1ed9",
      "text": "现在可不是说这种话的时候呢。\n唔唔～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e6b814e2aee9773d2cd02ae8db5265b9f13d3738b91540f7ce3ac94674c3b3",
      "text": "嗯——！\n好！去洗把脸吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a026540da24f5cc2e639cc6e984467e90da438cc1194e25081a4547300f5ee9f",
      "text": "呼——！洗完脸清醒过来了，\n接下来就是弄发型啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_01_1_2_020_01:1_2_020_01_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9d79cb7167cc9ee960854f4df86eaf75db78efd9b483655795f688ba746a66",
      "text": "今天也要帅气利落地搞定哦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
